1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,433
Pie's fresh! Cherry. Same as always.
Sit, sit, you look hungry.

2
00:00:03,933 --> 00:00:10,367
The diner is warm. A pie steams on the
counter. Another on every table. All
cherry. All the same slice missing.

3
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:15,700
Rule four. Never eat or drink what the
town offers. Carry your own water.
